  "environment": "Original crates.io bit_field0.10.3; x86_64 default features, debug extraction. Rust nightly-2026-09-17, Charon08d7c9d50144bd84848212c24701253585e90d1f, Aeneas be86ab0f1989d04944292b345b24c435be3ad10a, Lean4.35.0. Official original-body extraction with primitive monomorphization and separate generic slice roots. Kani0.68.0/CBMC6.11.0/Rust nightly-2026-08-21: 24 supplementary primitive harnesses/600 checks, plus the separate concrete range observation.",
